  "body": "LAST VIEWINGS THIS WEEKEND! \r\nWith a sharp price reduction, buyers have one final brief opportunity to secure this fantastic property before it is withdrawn from the market.  If you've been sitting on the fence, NOW is the time to act!\r\n\r\nOn a freehold title and solidly constructed of concrete block and brick with steel framing, this spacious family home offers unbeatable value for money in this fantastic central Orewa location.  With north facing living flowing beautifully to spacious outdoor entertaining, you’ll love relaxing or spending time with family and friends in the sunny courtyard while watching the kids play safely in the fully fenced garden.  \r\n\r\nFeatures you’ll love:\r\n\r\n• Freehold, easy care 280m2 section with no lawns to mow\r\n• Light filled interior and a spacious layout\r\n• Separate dining or second living room\r\n• Three double bedrooms and family bathroom on the upper level plus a convenient guest toilet on the ground level\r\n• Master bedroom with ensuite\r\n• Internal access double garage... ideal for storing the bikes and beach toys.\r\n\r\nLocated in the heart of popular Orewa, you’re an easy flat walk to the beach, quality schools, parks and the vibrant town centre with its array of cafes, restaurants and amenities and just a 2 minute drive to motorway access.  Lifestyle, location and price come together here to offer a fantastic opportunity you don’t want to miss!  This one WILL be sold so call today!",
